    {"name":"codes","ts":null,"params":[],"note":"The whole table of diagnostic codes, { \"MDT-E0101\": { title, explain }, ... } in the table's order, as CODES is written: every row of the Rust table, those added from language 0.6 on included: the rows of CODES, then the codes of 0.6, which CODES does not have."},
